# Campaign Intake — {{CAMPAIGN_TITLE}}

> **Optional input form.** This is an alternative to the live interview: a pre-filled questionnaire you can
> edit in a real text editor (easier than long terminal answers — paste references and equations freely).
> The agent fills what it can detect/harvest and leaves blanks where it needs you; you edit, then the agent
> **reads it back and asks only about what's still blank or ambiguous.** Blanks mean "ask me" or "you
> decide" — both handled gracefully. This same form is the **framing artifact** shared with `frame-problem`,
> so filling it once avoids a double-interview.
>
> Delete the form once the campaign is scaffolded, or keep it as the record of how the campaign was framed.

